1
00:00:00,432 --> 00:00:03,168
Hi there! What club do you want to join?

2
00:00:03,728 --> 00:00:05,712
I have no idea.

3
00:00:06,640 --> 00:00:08,128
Here’s some good news!

4
00:00:08,368 --> 00:00:10,864
Our school wants to start a music club.

5
00:00:11,392 --> 00:00:12,688
Do you want to join?

6
00:00:13,664 --> 00:00:16,320
Sure. I can play the guitar.

7
00:00:17,264 --> 00:00:18,960
What about you, Emma?

8
00:00:19,840 --> 00:00:24,688
I’d love to, but I can’t play any musical instruments.

9
00:00:25,408 --> 00:00:27,808
Oh, but you can sing well.

10
00:00:28,368 --> 00:00:30,944
Exactly! How about Ella?

11
00:00:31,472 --> 00:00:33,568
She can play the violin, right?

12
00:00:34,080 --> 00:00:35,648
Yes, she can.

13
00:00:36,352 --> 00:00:39,296
What instruments can you play, Teng Fei?

14
00:00:39,648 --> 00:00:41,376
I can play the drums.

15
00:00:41,680 --> 00:00:45,984
That’s great! Let’s go to the music room after school!

